  "body": " Section 02: Accessing Runestone Academy  Begin by going to https:\/\/landing.runestone.academy .  If you do not have a Runestone account, follow these instructions.   Click “Register and Get Started”    Under \"Student in a class,\" click the button for \"Sign up & Join”    This will take you to a page that allows you to pick a username, password, enter name, email, etc.   Please use your real first and last name; you can use any email and username you want.    Use \"(your university’s full name)\" for the institution.       Save your username and password somewhere.    Do NOT select that you are an instructor and want to create a course.    Click on \"Create Account.\"    On the next page, enter your course name: GVSU-MTH202-02-Fall-26.  While there may be another option to select the course from a list, don’t use that option. Again, just enter the course name as above.    Scroll all the way down and click \"Enroll\"    When it asks for a donation, select \"Sorry, not today.\"     If you do already have a Runestone account, log in, use the person icon go to the user menu and select “Change Course.”   Then scroll down if needed and choose “Enroll in Another Course.”    Enter the course name: GVSU-MTH-202-02-Fall-26.    Scroll all the way down and click \"Enroll\"     "
